{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54948","headline":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 五十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占鸟第二十二（京本作「占飞禽第二十」○八十三首） 五十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营内，赤鸟入於（京本作「其」）营。\n更有野鷄并野雉，须防风火与虚惊，皂帜厌爲精。\n（水克火，故用皂旗。\n如见赤色鸟入军营，覆将帐幕以皂旗白竿，立帐前三日，厌吉。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}